      "end_seconds": 5.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "Hello, um, doctor. May I come in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.13,
      "end_seconds": 10.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "no problem at all, come in what's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 11.4,
      "end_seconds": 16.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "oh, good morning, doctor i came along to help out"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.78,
      "end_seconds": 21.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "Of course, please stay. It's helpful to have you here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.66,
      "end_seconds": 31.64,
      "duration_seconds": 9.98,
      "text": "um, so... pain behind the ear that's why I came a neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.25,
      "end_seconds": 36.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.22,
      "end_seconds": 40.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Probably two days. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.95,
      "end_seconds": 45.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.02,
      "end_seconds": 55.14,
      "duration_seconds": 8.12,
      "text": "it happens on and off maybe a five out of ten on a bad day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.85,
      "end_seconds": 61.28,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "What about your face drooping on the right, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.84,
      "end_seconds": 63.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "Yeah, that too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.42,
      "end_seconds": 73.66,
      "duration_seconds": 9.24,
      "text": "Alright, and what about slurred speech, weakness in the arm or leg, headache or rash in the ear?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.52,
      "end_seconds": 84.06,
      "duration_seconds": 9.54,
      "text": "okay, so no, no slurred speech, weakness in the arm or leg, headache or rash in the ear"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.29,
      "end_seconds": 87.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Has your skin been okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.44,
      "end_seconds": 90.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.06,
      "text": "No rashes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.29,
      "end_seconds": 98.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Okay, your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.57,
      "end_seconds": 100.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "No problems with breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.62,
      "end_seconds": 113.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.3,
      "end_seconds": 116.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "I've got gout."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.48,
      "end_seconds": 126.36,
      "duration_seconds": 7.88,
      "text": "Okay, I can see gout in your file as well. What about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.32,
      "end_seconds": 132.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "My mother had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.33,
      "end_seconds": 139.86,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "Okay, tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.64,
      "end_seconds": 155.06,
      "duration_seconds": 10.42,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother. I grab fast food at lunch most days. I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.16,
      "end_seconds": 175.5,
      "duration_seconds": 9.34,
      "text": "Right, has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies. Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.25,
      "end_seconds": 184.79,
      "duration_seconds": 8.54,
      "text": "erm, I was told I'm allergic to cat fur, but I don't remember what reaction I had"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.37,
      "end_seconds": 189.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 191.05,
      "end_seconds": 196.23,
      "duration_seconds": 5.18,
      "text": "it's, It's allopurinol, 100 milligrams, once a day, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.3,
      "end_seconds": 200.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "right, time for your numbers, if that's okay"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.63,
      "end_seconds": 212.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.39,
      "end_seconds": 229.79,
      "duration_seconds": 7.4,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 109 over 73, pulse is 82 beats a minute, saturation 97 percent. And temperature 36.8."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.19,
      "end_seconds": 235.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.55,
      "end_seconds": 240.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Okay, we'll go over that shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.67,
      "end_seconds": 245.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.44,
      "end_seconds": 250.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.66,
      "end_seconds": 276.94,
      "duration_seconds": 8.28,
      "text": "The The whole right side of the face is weak, including the forehead, and the left side is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.21,
      "end_seconds": 281.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.84,
      "end_seconds": 309.69,
      "duration_seconds": 9.85,
      "text": "Putting it all together, the most likely explanation is Bell's palsy. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 311.09,
      "end_seconds": 314.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "oh, do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.94,
      "end_seconds": 332.32,
      "duration_seconds": 17.38,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's Bell's palsy, and we'll watch how it goes. Use eye drops and tape the eye shut at night to protect it. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 333.84,
      "end_seconds": 337.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "Mm, okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    }
  ]
}